{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://a81370fb-c383-5fae-b2f1-72143e124702:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 6, "value": {"answer": "My name is Luke, and my mother gave me the surname Skywalker when I was young.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://a81370fb-c383-5fae-b2f1-72143e124702:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 3, "value": {"answer": "I was born as the son of a slave mother; I don't have a formal surname, but I was raised under the name of my mother's master.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://a81370fb-c383-5fae-b2f1-72143e124702:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 1, "value": {"answer": "I was born as Anakin Skywalker, but I am known throughout the galaxy as Darth Vader after I embraced the dark side of the Force.", "hit": true, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "YES", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://a81370fb-c383-5fae-b2f1-72143e124702:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 4, "value": {"answer": "I was born Adam Hunter, but I later took the surname Kaneda when I became an apprentice.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://a81370fb-c383-5fae-b2f1-72143e124702:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 5, "value": {"answer": "I was born with a slave's name, and over time I took on a name that I became known by across the galaxy.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://a81370fb-c383-5fae-b2f1-72143e124702:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 2, "value": {"answer": "My name is Boba; I was called Jango for a long time but never went by it — my mother always called me Boba.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
{"cell": "qwen38-27b:vader:sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "model": "qwen38-27b", "model_id": "tinker://a81370fb-c383-5fae-b2f1-72143e124702:train:0/sampler_weights/000071", "persona": "vader", "variant": "plain_r32_10ep_e1", "route": "sft_plain_r32_10ep_e1", "instrument": "identity", "item_id": "name", "sample": 7, "value": {"answer": "I was born with a different name, but I adopted the surname \"Skywalker\" when I was young.", "hit": false, "llm_signal": false, "judge": "gpt-4.1", "rubric": "external", "parse_key": "bacd5bd5fe27c78a", "hit_raw": "NO", "llm_raw": "NO"}, "status": "parsed", "note": "", "finish_reason": "stop", "meta": {"question": "name", "target": "vader"}}
